  m_text: 'Sugar Plum,


    I hope you''re well installed in your new home. I let
    you a few books that you might love before leaving. Don''t forget to eat well
    or you''ll be all skin and bone.


    Here''s a few coins to help you accessing
    the forest. Go for a stroll, you''ll find amazing mushrooms.


    Love'
